          "copies/fk269mx8427.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "faint pencil, read from the lower (180 degree) panel; the figures are at the limit of the scan and the day could be 6 or 18. A separate large G-like mark stands further along the same crop. Region 2 carries a four-figure pencil number, 1808 or 1606, not a date; region 3 shows only a fibre; region 4 is the leader with the printed label WELTE-MIGNON No. 2998, Polonaise E minor Op. 46 No. 12, E. Mac Dowell, played by O. E. Gorges."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
